@startuml sequence-katalog-kendaraan
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #dae8fc
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #6c8ebf

actor Customer
participant "Browser" as B
participant "Next.js Page\n/katalog" as P
participant "API Route\n/api/cars" as A
participant "Prisma ORM" as PR
database "MySQL DB" as DB

Customer -> B: Buka halaman katalog
B -> P: GET /katalog
P -> A: fetch(/api/cars)
A -> PR: car.findMany()
PR -> DB: SELECT * FROM Car
DB --> PR: data kendaraan
PR --> A: List<Car>
A --> P: JSON response
P --> B: Render halaman katalog
B --> Customer: Tampilkan daftar kendaraan

Customer -> B: Klik salah satu kendaraan
B -> P: GET /katalog/[slug]
P -> A: fetch(/api/cars/[slug])
A -> PR: car.findUnique({slug})
PR -> DB: SELECT Car + CarVariant\n+ CarImage + CarHighlight
DB --> PR: data detail kendaraan
PR --> A: Car + relasi
A --> P: JSON response
P --> B: Render halaman detail
B --> Customer: Tampilkan spesifikasi & harga OTR

@enduml